        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises DS-25 Decorative Seashell Dome Floor Mount Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid brass, this decorative seashell style floor mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or commercial applications. Great door stop for your nautical theme rooms. \r\n</p>\r\nThis seashell door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount this  in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the door knob or lever as well. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFast and easy installation. Packaged with mounting hardware.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises FEI-DS-25 Shell Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter:  1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Floor to Bumper Height:  1\"</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Brass</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Hardware:  #12 x 1-1/2\" screw </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
