                "title": "Decorative Seashell Dome Door Stop, Field Enterprises FEI-DS-25",
                "description": "Field Enterprises DS-25 Shell Door Stops.  Constructed of solid brass, this Decorative Shell dome style floor mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or commercial applications. Great door stop for your nautical theme rooms. Available in Polished Brass, Antique Brass, Polished Chrome, Satin Nickel, Oil Rubbed Bronze, and Polished Nickel.",
                "keywords": "FEI-DS-25 Shell Design Floor Door Stops, nautical door stops,  Decorative Seashell  Door Stops, floor Door stops, floor door stoppers, Field Enterprises door stops, decorative door bumpers,  floor stops, solid brass floor door bumpers,  doorstoppers, wooden door stops, Field Enterprises DS-25 Dome Style Floor Door Stops, beach decor, Seashell Door Stops, nautical hardware,"
